  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F03_HumanEntryParents
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F03_HumanEntryParents
  notes: '17F03 parent explanation after Mia enters the unit. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F03_HumanEntryParents. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Laura
    text: Oh, thank God. That was quick. Is it broken? Can you fix it?
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Let me take a look first.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Please tell me you can do it tonight. This thing has been a godsend. The
      past year has been quiet. Actually quiet. Ava and I used to blow up at each
      other every few days. She's fourteen.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Mark and I both work. No one's here during the day. It keeps Ava company.
      She tells it things, it reports back to me, and I know what's going on. Then
      tonight it just shuts off out of nowhere?
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mark
    text: We cycled the power a few times. The screen never came back.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Okay. I'll pull the record.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Please hurry. Ava has school tomorrow.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
